; Quick iterative sync-test boot: replace the original driver but do not run
; the full asynchronous baseline. Run one of the tests in S: explicitly.
FailAt 21
MakeDir RAM:T
Assign T: RAM:T
Echo "Loading mastercard.device without the full baseline test."
Echo "Don't use the hard disk until you reboot."
MCDiag TAKEOVER LOADONLY
Echo "Ready: Execute S:sync-test"
Echo "Production-path test: Execute S:sync-driver-test"
Echo "Next optimization: Execute S:sync-offset-test"
Echo "Offset-8 driver test: Execute S:sync-driver-offset8-test"
Echo "After that passes: Execute S:sync-write-offset8-test"
Echo "Auto-sync build only: Execute S:auto-sync-driver-test"
Echo "Auto-sync repeat: Execute S:auto-sync-repeat-test"
